WEBVTT

00:02:28.610 --> 00:02:33.121
I've done the scrutiny of market data,
and I've found that, indeed,

00:02:33.145 --> 00:02:36.717
the washing machine
has penetrated below the air line,

00:02:36.741 --> 00:02:39.994
and today, there's an additional
one billion people out there

00:02:40.018 --> 00:02:42.276
who live above the "wash line."

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:44.276
(Laughter)

00:02:44.709 --> 00:02:48.345
And they consume
for more than 40 dollars per day.

00:02:48.369 --> 00:02:51.107
So two billion have access
to washing machines.

00:02:51.131 --> 00:02:54.058
And the remaining five billion --

00:02:54.082 --> 00:02:55.348
how do they wash?

00:02:55.372 --> 00:02:56.978
Or, to be more precise,

00:02:57.002 --> 00:03:00.349
how do most of the women
in the world wash?